  "customfield_10187": null,
  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Fedora objects contain RDF triples. These triples are added to the configured triplestore by the addAllDatastreamTriples method of BaseTripleGenerator.java",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "As of today, this method hard-codes \"RELS-EXT\" for addition to the triplestore.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Why not add all of the Fedora object's semantic information to the triplestore ?",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "I suggest modifying this method to add the triples contained by all datastreams that have the \"application/rdf+xml\" MIME type and the \"Internal XML Metadata\" control group.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "If we develop a patch for this, will it be accepted into Fedora's trunk ?",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Cheers,",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Nicolas Raoul.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
