  "description": "<p>Fedora objects contain RDF triples. These triples are added to the configured triplestore by the addAllDatastreamTriples method of BaseTripleGenerator.java</p>\n\n<p>As of today, this method hard-codes \"RELS-EXT\" for addition to the triplestore.</p>\n\n<p>Why not add all of the Fedora object's semantic information to the triplestore ?</p>\n\n<p>I suggest modifying this method to add the triples contained by all datastreams that have the \"application/rdf+xml\" MIME type and the \"Internal XML Metadata\" control group.</p>\n\n<p>If we develop a patch for this, will it be accepted into Fedora's trunk ?</p>\n\n<p>Cheers,<br/>\nNicolas Raoul.</p>",
